window.products.push({"id":143142,"name":"OEM 6601ER1004C Washer Door Lock Assembly by Beaquicy - Replacement for Ken-more L-G Washing Machine - Replace EBF49827801 EBF49827802 6601ER1004E 126","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612OVwqXkSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝑶𝑬𝑴 𝟔𝟔𝟎𝟏𝑬𝑹𝟏𝟎𝟎𝟒𝑪 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹 𝑫𝑶𝑶𝑹 𝑳𝑶𝑪𝑲】-- 6601ER1004C Washer Door Switch and Lock is used for gaskets and can be placed on the washing machine cover to open during the washing cycle and the spin cycle. It is made of high quality durable materials and have been rigorously tested to ensure long lasting and effective washer performance.If the switch shorts out and no longer transmits information to the machine, the switch cannot be locked. Package include 1 x 6601ER1004C Washer Door Lock Assembly. 【𝑨𝑩𝑺 𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪 𝑴𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑳】-- The 6601ER1004C L-G Door Lock is made of high quality ABS plastic and stainless steel metal material for excellent durability and firmness. High-quality materials make the lock stronger, less prone to breakage and less prone to cracking at the joints. Allows better locking and unlocking of the door. ➤If lock is broken, the washer will have the following conditions, and the lock need to be replaced in time: The washing machine will not start. Lid or the door will not close. The lid or the door will not open. Multiple codes running intermittent. DE error the washing machine stops under load. 【𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】-- The Washer Door Lock 6601ER1004C support 365 DAYS return and exchange. ➤The upgraded OEM door lock has been greatly enhanced in terms of materials and workmanship. The upgraded door lock has improved in terms of cracking and deformation and is less prone to wear and tear, making the door lock last longer. The door lock also has a better link fit at the joints and is less likely to separate. The door lock locks better when opening and closing the washing machine door so that the door will not open during operation. 【𝑲𝑬𝑵-𝑴𝑶𝑹𝑬 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑳-𝑮 𝑾𝑨𝑺𝑯𝑬𝑹】-- OEM 6601ER1004C EBF49827801 Washer Door Lock replacement for Ken-more, L-G washer. ➤Replaces: 6601ER1004C, 6601ER1004E, EBF49827802, 1268254, PS3533609, AP4998848, EAP3533609. ➤Compatible: wm2050cw, wm2650hwa, wm2650hra, wm2301hw, wm2688hnma, wm2010cw, wm2277hw, wm2277hs, wm3470hva, wm3875hvca, wm2688hnm, wm2688hnma, wm3150hwc, wm0642hw, wm2501hwa, wm2655hva, wm3987hw, wm2301hw, wm2250cw, wm2016cw, cw2079cwn, wm0532hw, wm1811cw, 79640318900, 79641379211, 79641722000, 79640512900, 79640518900, 79641022900, 79641373211, 79641472210, 79642199900, 79648842800, 79641172212, 79641372210, 79641379211, 79642192900, 79642198900, 79648842800, etc. 【𝑬𝑨𝑺𝒀 𝑰𝑵𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑳𝑳𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑶𝑵】-- The installation of 6601ER1004C Washer Door Lock Assembly is simple. Before installation, please disconnect the power and water supply and put on working glove. Remove 2 screws at the back of the lid.Lift lid off.Unplug the connector from the lock assembly will want to do this with the assembly still screwed in.Unscrew the 2 screws,hold assembly from inside while undoing the last screw, don't want it to fall to the bottom.Remove old assembly, put new one in. Once plugged in, install in proper position and screw back in place. NOTE: After installation, ensure that the lock is screwed in place and the equipment connected to the lock is firmly attached.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612OVwqXkSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083BRXSPM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083BRXSPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083BRXSPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
