window.products.push({"id":143243,"name":"137221600 134051200 Washer Drain Pump by Techecook (365-DAYS WARRANTY) - Replacement for Kenmore Frigidaire Washing Machine - Replacement Part 1371081","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yhBUw+9JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔✔【ITEM SPECIALITY & DURABLE】137221600 134051200 Washer Drain Pump removes water from the washer during the drain portion and sending it down the drain hose to exit the machine. If Water is leaking out of the bottom of your washer, the drum cannot drain water, or there’ s an unusual noise during use, you may need the 137221600 134051200 Washer Drain Pump. Washer pump 137221600 includes a firmly attached red flapper, it can Prevents drain backflow ✔✔【PACKAGE INCLUDES】1 x 137221600 Front Load Drain Pump,1 x mounting base and 1 x screw, the product specs of this washer drain pump are: Frequency: 60Hz, Watts: 85W and Voltage: 110V-127V. If the water pump is not functioning correctly, your washing machine may not be able to complete a cycle or may leave your clothes soaking wet at the end of the cycle. Kenmore washer pump 137108100 is cheap and of good quality, which can effectively solve your washing machine malfunction ✔✔【COMPATIBLE MODEL】137221600 137151800 Drain Pump is made exactly fit for most top name brands washing machine (Frigidaire, Kenmore, Electrolux, Crosley, U-ni, Westing-house, Gib-son). ▶replaces part numbers:137108100, AP5684706, 137151800, 131724000, 134051200, 134740500, 137108100, 2754548, ER137108100, PS7783938, TJ137108100,etc. ▶Fit for fex831fs4 gltf2940es3 atfb6700fs0 fwx445rfs3 fafw3801lw3 gltf2940fs1 and so on ✔✔【DIY INSTALLATION】Disconnect the power before installing this part. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. You’ll just need a Phillips screwdriver, pliers, towel, needle nose pliers, and small flathead screwdriver. The 137221600 Drain Pump Replacement is typically located at the bottom of the washing machine, and it is connected to the motor with two screws. Washer pump 137221600 is easy to install, you can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it to install it. Just a heads up once the pump is removed make sure you clean out the rubber boot and make sure your hose is fastened to the drain ✔✔【365-DAYS WARRANTY】Risk-free shopping, if the 137221600 137151800 Washing Machine Drain Pump has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately. Regular cleaning of the pump and its components, and timely replacement of worn or damaged parts, can extend the service life of the pump","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yhBUw+9JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08T8WX2FM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143243","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T8WX2FM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T8WX2FM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
