window.products.push({"id":143328,"name":"SINDA Copper Range Hood, 4-Speed Professional Staniless Steel Liner Insert, Dishwasher Safe Baffle Filters, LED Lamps, 48\"W x 27\"H, Oil Rubbed Bronze-","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":4202.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SP3m49poL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Size Guide】: 48\"W x 21\"D x 27\"H wall mount. For better performance, wall mount range hoods should be the same width as or 3\"- 6\" wider than your cooktop. The height range between your cooktop and the copper hood should be 30\" to 36\" (33\" is recommended). We can make any hood size you need, please contact our custom service via Amazon.com for a quote. 【Ventilation】: Comes with build-in/insert range hood with 4 speed fan, adjustable LED lights, baffle filter(reusable, dish-washer safe). 30\"/36\"W - max airflow(noise level):610 CFM(6.5Sone), 6\" round duct; 42\"/48\"W -max airflow(noise level): 1150 CFM(7.5Sone), 8\" round duct. ** Ductless conversion (recirculating) and remote blowers (motor in attic) ventilation options available upon request by email. 【Unique Features】: H13TR, the most Retro-inspired design of SINDA signature handmade range hood collection. Three sided, gentle bell curve but with lots of darker straps, lots of rivets, full of personality. Choose different texture and color to create a unique copper range hood that matches your interior decoration precisely, brings your kitchen a vintage old-world charm. This piece is also handmade in solid, 16 gauge pure copper, aesthetic and practical. 【Care & Maintenance】: SINDA copper hood come with a protective coating to preserve the finish you select. For daily maintenance, simply clean your copper hood with mild soap and warm water. Do not use copper polish, abrasive materials or harsh cleaners. 【Service & Warranty】: SINDA will provide CAD drawings for your approval upon receipt of your order. The hood pics will also be sent to you for approval before shipment. Want to get samples to touch the color and texture for yourself? Just feel free to contact us. ***SINDA offers a lifetime warranty on copper hood covers& a two-year parts limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51SP3m49poL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SINDA","source_asin":"B083QHHF8F","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083QHHF8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083QHHF8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
