window.products.push({"id":143601,"name":"Antallcky 8-Pack Silver Stove Burner Covers Gas Range Protectors Gas Cooktop Liner Cover Clean Mat Pad,Reusable, Non-Stick, Dishwasher Safe, Easy to C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FLRIwF8FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We are always focusing on product quality, so we are always treasuring customer feedbacks and reviews. After researching, we make the protectors better, more solid and more beautiful! WARNING : Avoid direct contact with flames or heating elements to avoid possible injuries, or damaging of the product.Protectors are not 100% fireproof. Trim pre-cut inner circle to fit the burner; trim outer edges if necessary. Make sure protector is kept at least 0.5 inch from the flame when when set to max. Features: - Protect your gas cooker from burning on spills.  - Perfect for most types of gas ranges  - Can be cut to size  - Non-Stick and Reusable  - More durable ,last much longer  - No warping, wrinkling or folding!  - Dishwasher-safe (And easier to clean by hand) Stovetop Burner Protectors - Set Of 8, Silver/Black Hate scrubbing your stovetop Simply place these fiberglass stovetop protectors over your gas burner areas, and your stovetop will stay clean and protected. Protectors easily catch splatters and spills. Can be wiped clean with soapy water. Q&A Question: You may wonder why it is heat resistant but not fireproof.Does it has contradictory? Answer: No.it has no contradictory.As the fire of stove burner is at least 1800°F,but the gas stove top covers just can resist about 500°F,Now at this price, there is no reusable product can resist above 1800°F.This is the reason why it is heat resistant but not fireproof.Please take note it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FLRIwF8FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Antallcky","source_asin":"B07B4FTS19","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143601","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B4FTS19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B4FTS19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
