window.products.push({"id":143607,"name":"W10594481 Stove Knobs Replacement for Whirlpool Gas Stove Range Oven Knobs WCG97US0DS00 WCG97US6DS00, Stainless Steel Burner Control Knob Replace WPW1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bB5DsgpML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"► WHIRLPOOL GAS RANGE STOVE KNOBS NOTES - W10594481 Gas Stove Knobs dosen't have \"Off\" and \"Ignite\" labels, Non-90 degree off, and it points down when off. This whirlpool range knobs looks very similar to W10818230, W10766544, W10826855 and W10698166, but they are different, When the valve pointer points to 12 o'clock,turn the W10594481 knob over the back，the direction is \"D\". Please confirm with your previous part to purchase the correct part. ► IDEAL WHIRLPOOL REPLACEMENT KNOBS - W10594481 range replacement knobs made from durable high-quality stainless steel which is heavy duty and has higher heat resistance than other knobs; The frosted material on the surface of w10594481 knob for whirlpool stove/range can increase the friction between your hand and the knob for easy manipulation; A metal ring is added at the interface to ensure the service life, while the valve stem is reinforced with an aluminum ring to prevent break easily. ► REPLACES PART NUMBER & COMPATIBLE MODELS - W10594481 Whirlpool Gas Stovetop Knobs suitable for W10594481, WPW10594481, AP6023301, 3281332, W10594481, PD00034064, PS11756643, EAP10594481,B01KR8F5EU, WCG97US0DS00, WCG97US6DS00 etc. W10594481 Stove Control Knobs suitable for models starting with WCG97 (WCG97US0DS00,WCG97US6DS00,WCG55US0HS00,WCG51US6DB00,WCG51US6DB00 WEG745H0FS0 WCG55US6HS WEG745HOFSO) WEG745H0FS0. But not for WCG97US0DS ► EASY TO INSTALL - The W10594481 cooker stove control knob replacement for whirlpool with a 0.18in \"D\" axis and the installation is simple. Replace W10594481 Whirlpool Gas Cooktop Range knobs without any tools. Mainly slide the old knob directly out of the valve stem, and then slide the replacement knob back to the valve stem. Do not bend the W10594481 stove knob up or down. Only few minutes you can keep your cooktop looking brand new. ► WARRANTY & SUPPORT - 5 Pack W10594481 Control Knobs are premium quality and well-tested before shipping. While this is NOT a genuine Whirlpool knob, it will fit perfectly like the original. Truly worry-free 3-month warranty and friendly customer service. If the W10594481 Oven knobs fails on your cooktop, feel freely to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bB5DsgpML._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BTNTVEN","source_asin":"B08R6327NH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R6327NH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R6327NH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
