window.products.push({"id":143629,"name":"OEM AJU75152601 AJU73213301 Water Inlet Valve Replaces for Kenmore LG Washing Machine Inlet Valve 5221EA1008P 5221EA1008F AJU75152603 TAW35618287 3309","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mRO4MC5YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔✔【OEM AJU73213301 WATER INLET VALVE】:AJU75152601 AJU73213301 Washer water inlet valve is an original equipment manufacturer part and it made from high-quality stainless steel metal and ABS plastic material, strong and durable, tight connection, not easy to leak. AJU75152601 water inlet valve assembly controls the water flow into the washer, includes the hot water inlet valve, cold water inlet valve, bleach dispenser valve, fabric softener dispenser valve and jet spray valve. ✔✔【PACKAGE INCLUDES】:Including 1 X AJU75152601 AJU73213301 washer water inlet valve, 2 x AGM73269501 water inlet valve screen. The water inlet valve AJU73213301 is approximately 8.7 inches in length. ▶AJU73213301 washer water inlet valve controls the flow of water into the washing machine. ▶If your washer has the following symptoms: ①Leaking water inlet valve ②Repeating IE (input error) code ③Overflowing or stopping during the cycle ④Slow water inlet speed ⑤Noisy, you need to replace the it. ✔✔【COMPATIBLE MODELS】:AJU73213301 washing machine water inlet valve fits LG, Kenmore top-load washers. Replace:33090048 2660126 AP5668417 EAP6448324 PS6448324. ▶Fits for LG: WT4970CW, WT5170HW, WT5680HVA, WT5170HV, WT4870CW, WT7700HWA, WT5480CW, WT5270CW, WT5680HWA, WT6001HV, WT6001HW, WT7600HWA, WT7600HKA, WT1901CW, WT7200CW, etc. ▶Fits for Kenmore: 79631512210, 79631512211, 79631513310, 79631522210, 79631523210, 79631622310, 79631623310, 79631513210, 79631523211, 79631552610, 79631553610, etc. ✔✔【DIY INSTALLATION】:Please disconnect the power and water supply before performing any repairs and wear work gloves to protect your hands. The Installation of AJU73213301 water inlet valve is simple and takes less than 10 minutes. You can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it to install OEM AJU75152601 washer water inlet valve for lg washer. ▶Notice: When installing, please connect the water valve firmly to the water pipe and washing machine to ensure that the connection will not leak. ✔✔【10 YEARS WARRANTY】:During the 10 years warranty period, if the AJU73213301 lg washer valve has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you have any questions about our product or services, please contact us immediately. ▶AJU73213301 washer water inlet valve assembly controls the flow of water into the washing machine with two inlet valve screens to filter out impurities in the water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61mRO4MC5YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08W54C6W2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143629","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08W54C6W2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08W54C6W2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
