window.products.push({"id":143761,"name":"Broan 15BL Elite Trash Compactor with Storage Compartment and Odor Control System, 15-Inch, Flat Black Door","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519gkXEnkAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Beautiful lines and a rich finish in appliance-matching colors makes this compactor a seamless addition to your kitchen work area. It features a crushing mechanism with an industry-leading 3,000 pounds of continual force and over twice the horsepower of competitors, for the highest compaction ratio on the market. Painted steel compacting plate is specially designed to efficiently crush bottles and cans so you can dispose of nearly any object with confidence. Fully enclosed cabinet has adjustable Height and is painted with a fingerprint resistant coating to maintain a clean appearance. Integral bag storage compartment means bags are always handy and ready for use. Optional toe kick kit allows you to finish off freestanding installations neatly. The reversible hinged door allows installation to suit your kitchen layout. Turn the activation key, close the door and touch one button. That's it! Another chore is finished. From the Manufacturer Broan Elite: Proof that a trash compactor can look smashing. Convenience made easy in a few simple steps. Like its more automated sibling, Broan Elite trash compactors simplify waste containment and removal. A full-swinging, reversible door opens to an easy-to-clean compartment and a full-extension trash bucket. Its simplified control panel requires just two settings to start the process. Turn the activation key, close the door and touch one button. That's it. Removing the compacted bag is easy, too—lower the bucket front and slide the bag forward to the floor. There's no more lifting over the side. Broan Elite compactors also use our exclusive six-month odor control and neutralizing system. Rotate the dial once a month and a fresh segment is ready to work. Broan has been designing these convenience appliances for nearly 40 years, refining the product while defining the category. And the result A new line of products that is the perfect complement to today's high-style appliances, and environmentally-conscious homeowners. Broan Elite XE and Broan Elite trash compactors take convenience, hygiene and style to a new level.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/519gkXEnkAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan","source_asin":"B001PMZ96C","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143761","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001PMZ96C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B001PMZ96C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
