window.products.push({"id":143788,"name":"Cenipar W10404050 Washer Lid Lock & Latch Assembly Compatible with Washing Machine Replaces W10238287/W10404050VP/W10744659","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iMhwx8utL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"✅【PACKAGE LIST】: W10404050 washer lid lock & latch assembly. The package list includes 1 x 4-wire plastic plug connection, 2 x lid lock bezels (1 x white bezel, 1 x grey bezel ), 1 x instruction sheet. ✅【KEEP SAFE & FUNCTION】:The W10404050 lid lock assembly can be used to detect whether the lid of the washing machine is open or closed to ensure safety and prevent accidents. Prevent someone from reaching into the washer while it is spinning.This is a safety measure especially for children. When W10404050 washer lid lock detects that the washing machine is turned on, the washing machine stops bathtub rotating.(Please power off before installation.) ✅【SOLVE PROBLEMS】:Washer door latch assembly prevents the washer lid from opening during the wash cycle and spin cycle. W10404050 allows you to fix the most common issues as following: ①Lid lock switch intermittant malfunction Lid will not close ; ②Washer would not start and lid will not open; ③Washer would not cycle to wash after filling not washing properly; ④Washer would not cycle pumps but will not spin. ✅【WIDELY COMPATIBILITY】:W10404050 washer lid lock & latch assembly is suitable for most washing machine models.The W10404050 washing machine lid latch switch is perfectly compatible with Whirl-pool, Ken-more, May-tag, Ama-na and Cro-sely washing machines.Replaces W10238287, W10404050VP, W10744659, 1938607, AP5263307, PS3497627, AH3497627, EA3497627, LP15959, etc. ✅【180 DAYS WARRANTY】:6 MONTHS WARRANTY, 💡 RISK-FREE SHOPPING 💡 If you have any question, please don't hesitate to contact us. We will try our best to satisfy every customer.We will stictly carry out the quality-control project,which will enable our customers to buy with confidence and use with satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iMhwx8utL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cenipar","source_asin":"B08CGSY27W","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143788","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CGSY27W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CGSY27W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
