window.products.push({"id":143802,"name":"5231EL1001C Lint Trap Filter by Beaquicy - Replacement for Dryer Fit Dlex5170w Dley1201v Dle1101w Dle4870w Dle5001w Dlex5680v - Dry Lint Screen Replac","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hfM4EtspS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"𝐒𝐔𝐏𝐏𝐎𝐑𝐓 𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝐃𝐀𝐘𝐒 𝐑𝐄𝐓𝐔𝐑𝐍 & 𝐄𝐗𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐍𝐆𝐄 - 𝐑𝐈𝐒𝐊-𝐅𝐑𝐄𝐄 𝐒𝐇𝐎𝐏𝐏𝐈𝐍𝐆. Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.If you have any quality problem during warranty period,please contact customer service in time.Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. 𝟓𝟐𝟑𝟏𝐄𝐋𝟏𝟎𝟎𝟏𝐂 𝐃𝐑𝐘𝐄𝐑 𝐋𝐈𝐍𝐓 𝐅𝐈𝐋𝐓𝐄𝐑--- You will get 1 x 5231EL1001C Dryer lint trap filter. Filter Size is about W 10 inch x L 12.2 inch. Dryer lint screen 5231EL1001C helps catch lint and other debris that enter your dryer and could potentially cause a dryer-related fire.If not being trapped in the lint filter, lint will collect in the dryer vent hose. This can increase the risk of fire and decrease the efficiency and lifespan of your dryer.If the following symptoms occur, please replace it in time:①The plastic side of the filter is cracked; ②Clogged or worn lint filter; ③The filter is cracked; ④Lint filter is bent. 𝐖𝐈𝐃𝐄 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐁𝐈𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘--- ▶Replaces number: 1668214, AP5248138, EAP3527575,PS3527575. ＃𝐊𝐄𝐍𝐌𝐎𝐑𝐄 79661412310 79661412410 79661422410 79661423410 79669002000 79669002010 79669272000 79669272010 79671412310 79671412410 79671412910 79671415910 79671417910 79679002000 79679002010 79679272000 79679272010＃𝐋𝐆 DLE1001W DLE1101W DLE1501W DLE4801W DLEX5101V DLEX5101W DLEX5170V DLEX5170W LEY1201V DLEY1201W DLEY1701V DLEY1701VE DLGX5102V DLGX5102W DLGX5171V DLGX5171W DLGY1902WE 𝐌𝐨𝐫𝐞 𝐜𝐨𝐦𝐩𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐛𝐥𝐞 𝐦𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐬 𝐚𝐫𝐞 𝐥𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐢𝐧 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐝𝐞𝐬𝐜𝐫𝐢𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧. 𝐄𝐗𝐂𝐄𝐏𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍𝐀𝐋 𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘--- 5231EL1001C dryer lint filter is made from durable high quality ABS material that helps increase airflow to maximize drying efficiency and reduce drying time, effectively trapping lint and other debris entering the dryer.There is a felt seal along the edge that prevents air from escaping from the outer edge of the filter.Dense and smooth filters effectively filter lint without impeding air flow.The sturdy frame pulls the whole screen tightly so that the filter has the same tension in use without dents and is long lasting. 𝐄𝐀𝐒𝐘 𝐓𝐎 𝐈𝐍𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐋𝐋--- Before replacing 5231EL1001C l-g dryer lint you need to pay attention to: before turning on the strainer, use a screwdriver to remove stains from the track. Take out the old dryer filter and install the new one in the right place. A little snug at first, normal for new parts, After many uses it fit your dryer nicely.Before the first use, it is necessary to remove the accumulation of fluff in, around and under the dryer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81hfM4EtspS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08GC6F57V","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GC6F57V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GC6F57V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
