window.products.push({"id":143843,"name":"Beaquicy MP21YA Burner Surface Element 8 Inch 5 Turns,Suitable for Whirlpool Maytag Kenmore rp111pxsq1, kf330add1,xfc31050ab,rf264lxsb,etc.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Q6lUd6YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Upgraded Mp21YA burner surface element 】:MP21YA Burner Surface Element supplies the heat to a cooking area on top of the range.This is a large 8\" burner and has a \"Y\" style bracket. The specification is 2100 watts, 240 volts, and 5 turns. The turns are how many times the coil goes around in a circle.If the range burner does not sit flat on your stove, make sure the connection bolts are parallel and pushed a bit down.Please check the dimensions as shown on the photos to ensure they fit your stove before purchasing. ✅【Mp21ya 8\"5Turns Burner】:The package includes 1×MP21YA burner surface element 8 inches. The product is a plug-in type, plugged into a plastic socket. The replacemrnt part is made of non-metallic materials with high resistivity, low temperature coefficient of resistance, small high-temperature deformation, and low embrittlement of MP21YA electric stove burner components, meets OEM standards - ensure long-lasting and effective performance. This material can be used for a long time. ✅【Most coils are standard size and plug in】: MP21YA 8 burner element can replacement for Whirl-pool, May-tag, Ken-more Burner. ◆Replacement Numbers: WPY04100166, 4381750, Y0E00801799, 400178, 19950009, 1938-344, 1938-249, 15928, 0E00801799, 04100166, SU306, MP26YA, MP26M, MP21U, MP21MA, 5304431014, 484783, SU204, TS5W8221, 404099, Y04000033, S58Y21, SU205, 660532, TS4W6215, 04080, 5303310283, 04000034, WB30T10089, Y04000034, 484782, 9761347, 12001231, S46Y15, 8053268, 9761345, 8053268,9761345, 4165352,4389732, etc. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】:The MP21YA whirl-pool 8 inch burner element supports 365 days return and exchange.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】:Unplug your burner or turn off the circuit breaker before beginning install. Prepare a phillips screwdriver and work gloves.Remove screw pull old element out install new one put screw back in.There is a protective coating on the new MP21YA 8 inch burner replacement. When the item is used for the first time, the protective coating will volatilize a little smoke with high temperature, this is normal. Continue to use for about 20 minutes, and it will not smoke again next time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717Q6lUd6YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0881FR93X","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143843","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0881FR93X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0881FR93X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
