window.products.push({"id":143862,"name":"bonVIVO Muvo Stainless Steel Milk Jug With Copper Finish, Milk Frother Pitcher 12 Fl-Oz, Barista Tools Milk Frothing Pitcher With Practical Scale, Per","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VKMSkS+OL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"&#10004 FOR MILK LOVERS: The Muvo milk jug made of stainless steel allows you to enjoy your milk just as you would if a barista prepared it. Enjoy the rich flavor of hot, cold, frothed or steamer milk. This jug is a must have in your collection of barista accessories and is suitable for all milk lovers who enjoy good milk in their cappuccinos or espressos. The stainless steel pitcher can be used as a milk frother jug, to measure liquids and to serve cream. &#10004 FOR MILK LOVERS: The Muvo milk jug made of stainless steel allows you to enjoy your milk just as you would if a barista prepared it. Enjoy the rich flavor of hot, cold, frothed or steamer milk. This jug is a must have in your collection of barista accessories and is suitable for all milk lovers who enjoy good milk in their cappuccinos or espressos. The stainless steel pitcher can be used as a milk frother jug, to measure liquids and to serve cream. &#10004 QUALITY: The milk frothing jug is made of high quality stainless steel and is coated with a hard-wearing copper finish, which makes the metal milk pot absolutely unbreakable, rustproof and heat resistant. As the stainless steel milk jug is also taste-neutral and BPA-free, flavor is not affected, and no harmful substances are released into your drinks. You can froth your milk safely with this stunning indispensable coffee accessories. &#10004 DESIGN: Thanks to its modern, elegant design, bonVIVO's milk jug is not only practical but is also a real eye-catcher. The stainless steel milk jug with its trendy copper look fits into every modern kitchen. The pourer of this metal milk frothing jug is shaped in such a way that pouring is easy and precise and also allowing it become a coffee frother or creamer pitcher. &#10004 PRACTICAL MEASURING SCALE: Inside the small milk jug there is a practical measuring scale. The barista milk jug allows you to choose exactly the right amount of hot or cold milk (especially useful when used as a frothing jug for milk). The milk jug has a capacity of 1.5 cups or 350 ml, an absolute companion for your capuccino and expresso maker. &#10004 DELIVERY & CLEANING: You will receive one version of the bonVIVO Muvo milk jug. The stainless steel jug can be easily cleaned by hand with warm water and mild detergent. The metal milk jug is not dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51VKMSkS+OL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"bonVIVO","source_asin":"B07DL7BJZM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143862","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DL7BJZM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DL7BJZM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
