window.products.push({"id":143965,"name":"DyBaxa Ice Makers Countertop, 9 Cubes/6 Mins Portable Ice Maker Machine, 26Lbs Ice/24Hrs Self-Cleaning Ice Cube Maker, 2 Size Bullet Ice Maker with Sc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716cMFtRyhL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍍 FAST ICE MAKING 🍓 Equipped with the high-quality compressor, this portable ice maker machine could produce approximately 9 ice cubes in 6 minutes. Fill 2L of water into the water tank, maximum ice capacity can reach 26 pounds in 24 hours. Enclosed with 5pcs Ice Bag to store 50lbs Ice and prevent ice-melt. You can always have fresh ice on hand with this countertop ice maker (noise level less than 45 dB). 🍍 PORTABLE MACHINE 🍓 Lightweight feature(only weight 16.6 pounds) makes it portable for using anywhere. Additionally, the countertop ice maker's 8.7\"*12.3\"*12.6\" compact design makes it perfect for a variety of locations. Accessories - Comes with Ice Basket and Scoop. Kind Tips: The finished ice cubes need to be moved to the refrigerator for storage, the ice maker does not have a keep warm function. 🍍 SELF-CLEANING FUNCTION 🍓 Ice cube maker comes with an advanced self-cleaning function, just press the \"CLEAN\" button for 3s after adding water to operate the self-cleaning mode. Regular machine cleaning helps to get rid of unhealthy elements and extend the life of the portable ice maker countertop. 🍍 2 SIZES BULLET-SHAPED ICE CUBES 🍓 The elegant and lovely bullet-shaped ice cubes are ideal for whisky, cold beverages, frozen food, or first aid and won't stick together easily. Meanwhile, this countertop ice maker has two ice sizes( S/L) to choose from, large ice cubes are not easy to melt and small ice cubes are ideal to cool drinks quickly. 🍍 TRANSPARENT COVER & SMART REMINDER 🍓 The transparent lid allows you to monitor the ice capacity, ice makers countertop. When the basket is full, our ice maker countertop indicators will remind you to take out the ice cubes, and when the ice maker is low on water, it will alert you to add more. Ice maker for freezer, comes with a standard 1-year warranty covering any quality issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716cMFtRyhL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DyBaxa","source_asin":"B0B141BX22","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-143965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B141BX22","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B141BX22","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
